*   **`TestRequest`**: Used to construct HTTP requests (GET, POST, DELETE, etc.) with headers and URIs.
*   **`init_service` & `call_service`**: Used to initialize an in-memory service and call it directly without a network socket.
*   **Mocking**: By passing mock handles to your API functions, you isolate the networking logic from external I/O.
